    "Modelling is the fourth stage where an appropriate AI/ML algorithm is selected and trained on the prepared data to find patterns and make predictions.",
    "Common types of models include classification (categorizing data into groups), regression (predicting numerical values), and clustering (finding natural groupings in data).",
    "The choice of model depends on the type of problem (classification vs regression), the nature of data (structured vs unstructured), and the desired outcome.",
    "Evaluation is the fifth and final stage where the trained model is tested using new, unseen data to check if it performs accurately and meets the defined success criteria.",
